        "value": "三小隊　但一小隊五十人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "三小隊　但し一小隊五十人（さんしょうたい　ただし いっしょうたい ごじゅうにん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Troops: three companies, with a note in smaller type that one company numbers fifty men, so 150 men in all. The column stands to the left of Akō's officials and to the right of the ○綾部藩 marker, which is where a domain's military line belongs in fascicle 9 — it prints after that domain's officials and before the next domain's marker. The line is therefore Akō's and not Ayabe's, and MASTER files it that way (兵隊 三小隊(50) = 150 persons). The page prints no field label; the label 兵隊 is supplied by the project dataset."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "赤穗藩兵隊"
      }
